  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 pound) whole turkey, neck and giblets removed",
    "0.75 cup olive oil",
    "2 tablespoons garlic powder",
    "2 teaspoons dried basil",
    "1 teaspoon ground sage",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yWbIFhGmDbIoU1YFGcbdm9b1gqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey-ingredients-2-4x3-c06696ccc27f4600b3b3abcf9fc15010.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41393/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Clean turkey and pat dry with paper towels. Place in a roasting pan with a lid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TBMMaVsvUhj-CHT2EQ4Qobj47pE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey-step-01-2-4x3-9909f04b544e4537b8f7aa88e8be690e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41393/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine olive oil, garlic powder, basil, sage, salt, and pepper in a small bowl. Use a basting brush to apply the herb mixture all over the outside of the uncooked turkey. Pour 2 cups water into the bottom of the roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/creL-SBaCkT-JKXGzhNoLFtEnnk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey-step-03-2-4x3-3a73c5b595ff4ef3b37e934f3460d93b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41393/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the pan and roast in the preheated oven until the internal temperature of the thickest part of the thigh measures 180 degrees F (82 degrees C) with an instant-read thermometer, 3 to 3 1/2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X-q3TYm9M9tYgNCbt0EHuwps444=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey-step-05-4x3-7e95687a23e64c3db5f1ae54569b7d7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41393/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove turkey from the oven, and allow to stand for about 30 minutes before carving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1SHO5DuShc_pzow_Cked5BVccMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey-vat-4X3-4-a844feec1db64586b3a86e278d9eb1ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41393/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IvtESnrH6bavLqXRS0lO5sbZm1o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/41393-easy-herb-roasted-turkey31-4x3-6d044270925446dd8333025fd61986b5.jpg"
